    "setting": "A light modern fictional Oz, centered on Munchkin Country: orchard villages, blue-painted community rooms, the maintained yellow brick road, ordinary buses, phones, kitchens, workshops, and seasonal gatherings. Settlement names are invented local labels, not real locations or canonical geography.",
